# Security headers for Cloudflare Pages. Lighthouse flagged all of these as
# missing: no HSTS, no frame policy, no COOP.
#
# Strict-Transport-Security deliberately omits includeSubDomains. This zone
# carries subdomains that are not this site — passbolt, weather-7 — and a
# blanket subdomain policy would speak for them too. Widen it only after every
# one of them is confirmed HTTPS-only.
#
# No Content-Security-Policy here. The page carries an inline GA4 loader, so a
# useful CSP needs a hash or nonce plumbed through the template; a policy loose
# enough to allow 'unsafe-inline' would buy nothing.
/*
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  X-Frame-Options: DENY
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy: same-origin
  Permissions-Policy: geolocation=(), camera=(), microphone=(), interest-cohort=()
